{"id":"n73266-4-4","stage":1,"title":"푸르다 · (喻义)年轻而充满生气。","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73266-4-4-1","ko":"내 아들도 올해로 스무 살이네.","zh":"我儿子今年也二十岁了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아들도","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올해로","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스무","meaning":"二十","explanation":"스무：二十","readings":[{"term":"스무","audio":"/audio/f2a3c2a22b0891b766bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17822","senseId":"1","lemma":"스무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살이네.","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"f2a3c2a22b0891b7","term":"스무","zh":"二十","audio":"/audio/f2a3c2a22b0891b766bf.mp3","entryId":"17822","definition":"二十的。","pronunciation":["스무"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]}],"audio":"/audio/1239a8f70bd42336f56f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73266-4-4-2","ko":"스무 살이면 한창 푸를 나이지.","zh":"二十岁正是最朝气蓬勃的年纪啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"스무","meaning":"二十","explanation":"스무：二十","readings":[{"term":"스무","audio":"/audio/f2a3c2a22b0891b766bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17822","senseId":"1","lemma":"스무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살이면","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한창","meaning":"正旺，正盛，正是时候","explanation":"한창：正旺，正盛，正是时候","readings":[{"term":"한창","audio":"/audio/70d63477a23d3b8c1e7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89055","senseId":"1","lemma":"한창","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"푸를","meaning":"(喻义)年轻而充满生气。","explanation":"푸르다：(喻义)年轻而充满生气。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"푸르다","audio":"/audio/5561c8df92984a204e20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73266","senseId":"4","lemma":"푸르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이지.","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f2a3c2a22b0891b7","term":"스무","zh":"二十","audio":"/audio/f2a3c2a22b0891b766bf.mp3","entryId":"17822","definition":"二十的。","pronunciation":["스무"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"70d63477a23d3b8c","term":"한창